{title: Jacob's Ladder}
{artist: Traditional spiritual}
{genre: Gospel}
{style: Spiritual}
{flow: Response}
{key: G}
{key_original: D}
{tempo: 92}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]We are climbing Jacob's ladder
We are [C]climbing Jacob's [G]ladder
We are climbing Jacob's [D]ladder
Sol[G]diers of the [D]cross[G]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Every round goes higher, higher
[C]Every round goes higher, [G]higher
Every round goes higher, [D]higher
Sol[G]diers of the [D]cross[G]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]Sinner, do you love my Jesus?
[C]Sinner, do you love my [G]Jesus?
Sinner, do you love my [D]Jesus?
Sol[G]diers of the [D]cross[G]
{end_of_verse}
